  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41699646",
      "title": "Adding Search To A React App",
      "sourceHash": "38e0ffc3cba4c499216d21849dc131bb72c8f2803d5ba0ee84b8204bbc9fa09f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.87,
          "en": "So let's add the search logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.87,
          "end": 5.64,
          "en": "to SearchableList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.64,
          "end": 9.72,
          "en": "For that, we can start by managing some state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.72,
          "end": 12.03,
          "en": "to store the current search term",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.03,
          "end": 15.123,
          "en": "that was entered by the user into this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 18.78,
          "en": "Initially, this could be an empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.78,
          "end": 22.35,
          "en": "but then, I, of course wanna update that state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.35,
          "end": 25.623,
          "en": "whenever the user does type into that input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.3,
          "end": 30.18,
          "en": "So here we have the state and the state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.18,
          "end": 33.12,
          "en": "Next, we can add a function called handleChange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 36.91,
          "en": "for example, where we get an event automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.98,
          "end": 41.52,
          "en": "since all connect this function to the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.52,
          "end": 44.25,
          "en": "through the built-in onChange prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 46.863,
          "en": "as we did it many times before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.75,
          "end": 51.96,
          "en": "That will then make sure that we get to this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.96,
          "end": 54.9,
          "en": "And then in here, we can set the search term",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.9,
          "end": 58.11,
          "en": "to event.target.value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.11,
          "end": 60.933,
          "en": "So to the text entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.86,
          "end": 63.84,
          "en": "Now, with that state being managed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.84,
          "end": 67.05,
          "en": "we can then derive the search results,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.05,
          "end": 69.9,
          "en": "solve the items that should actually be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.9,
          "end": 71.793,
          "en": "based on that search term.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.08,
          "end": 77.01,
          "en": "By taking all the items we could potentially render,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.01,
          "end": 80.1,
          "en": "so all the items we receive through props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.1,
          "end": 82.74,
          "en": "and calling the filter method on items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.74,
          "end": 84.57300000000001,
          "en": "expecting this to be an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.46000000000001,
          "end": 88.62,
          "en": "Now, filter then should return true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.62,
          "end": 92.4,
          "en": "if an item should be kept or false if it should be dropped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.4,
          "end": 95.03999999999999,
          "en": "And we have to pass a function to filter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.03999999999999,
          "end": 98.64,
          "en": "which will be executed automatically by JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.64,
          "end": 100.28999999999999,
          "en": "And then it's this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.28999999999999,
          "end": 102.813,
          "en": "that should return true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.00999999999999,
          "end": 107.58,
          "en": "And here in that function, I will return true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.58,
          "end": 111.39,
          "en": "by using the built-in JSON stringify function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.39,
          "end": 114.09,
          "en": "to convert every item that we receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.09,
          "end": 117.063,
          "en": "to a parsable, readable string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.2,
          "end": 120.72,
          "en": "And then I'll convert all the text in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.72,
          "end": 125.52,
          "en": "to lowercase and check if that text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.52,
          "end": 128.7,
          "en": "so that converted item, all to lowercase",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.7,
          "end": 133.11,
          "en": "if that text includes the search term",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.11,
          "end": 136.653,
          "en": "also converted to lowercase, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 142.14,
          "en": "That's now my logic for deriving true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 142.14,
          "end": 145.74,
          "en": "Now, you could come up with a more refined search logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 149.193,
          "en": "but this basic logic should do here for this example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 152.1,
          "en": "Now, you could definitely come up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.1,
          "end": 155.88,
          "en": "with a more refined search logic here if you wanted to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.88,
          "end": 158.553,
          "en": "but for this example here, this will do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 159.54,
          "end": 161.82,
          "en": "And now, it's the search results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.82,
          "end": 165.543,
          "en": "that should be output down here with that map method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.47,
          "end": 171.47,
          "en": "Now, with that, if we save this and we go back to the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 173.01,
          "end": 175.92000000000002,
          "en": "you will see in that second search box,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.92000000000002,
          "end": 179.05,
          "en": "that if I type a one, I only see item one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 180.03,
          "end": 181.92,
          "en": "because item two does not include",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.92,
          "end": 184.26,
          "en": "the character one in its text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.26,
          "end": 187.143,
          "en": "If I type something more complex, I don't see anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 188.13,
          "end": 190.17,
          "en": "If I type two, I just see item two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 190.17,
          "end": 192.87,
          "en": "If I type item, I see both.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.87,
          "end": 196.77,
          "en": "For the first searchable list, it also works like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.77,
          "end": 199.86,
          "en": "but there, it's not as easy to see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 199.86,
          "end": 204.573,
          "en": "Here, we are dealing with some places data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.5,
          "end": 209.01,
          "en": "and if I would, for example, type in African,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.01,
          "end": 211.56,
          "en": "I would indeed only filter the list down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.56,
          "end": 213.3,
          "en": "to this one single place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.3,
          "end": 215.76,
          "en": "But since we're currently outputting it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 215.76,
          "end": 216.993,
          "en": "we wouldn't see that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 218.37,
          "end": 222.42000000000002,
          "en": "But we can see that the search logic seems to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 222.42000000000002,
          "end": 224.61,
          "en": "But the problem we're now facing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 224.61,
          "end": 228.63,
          "en": "is that this searchable list is great at searching stuff",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 228.63,
          "end": 231.363,
          "en": "but not that great at outputting stuff.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 232.74,
          "end": 236.28,
          "en": "And that it should be usable with all kinds of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 236.28,
          "end": 238.44,
          "en": "in all kinds of formats.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 238.44,
          "end": 242.013,
          "en": "Hence, it can't output that data in a correct way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 243.12,
          "end": 245.97,
          "en": "Because for simple strings, we might want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 245.97,
          "end": 248.13,
          "en": "to output the string text like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.13,
          "end": 250.62,
          "en": "And for more complex objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.62,
          "end": 253.59,
          "en": "we might wanna output a more complex markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 253.59,
          "end": 256.863,
          "en": "And that's where render props can now help us.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}